{
  "info": {
    "name": "Ticket Booking - Phase 6 (microservices, core)",
    "description": "Ticket Booking API, Phase 6, with Payment connected to Booking: the important requests only, for one organizer and one user.\n\nHOW TO RUN\n1. Start everything in this order: the 4 databases, config-server, eureka-server, user-service, cinema-service, payment-service, booking-service, then api-gateway. Wait about 30 seconds so every service shows up in Eureka.\n2. Every request goes through the API Gateway (baseUrl, port 8080).\n3. The organizer is created by DevDataSeeder in user-service (app.seed.enabled: true): organizer@ticket.com, password Organizer@123.\n4. Run the folders in order. Tokens and ids are saved into collection variables by the test scripts.\n5. A booking is paid inside the same request. The fake payment gateway declines any amount above payment.gateway.max-amount (10000 in payment-service.yml), which is what folder 6 relies on.\nRe-running is safe: registration accepts 201 or 409, and each run creates a new movie and shows.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register user (201, or 409 if already registered)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "register"
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Alice User\",\n  \"email\": \"{{userEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{userPassword}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"201 created, or 409 if already registered\", function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([201, 409]); });",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.test(\"role is USER\", function () { pm.expect(b.role).to.eql(\"USER\"); });",
                  "  pm.test(\"no password or hash in response\", function () { pm.expect(b).to.not.have.property(\"password\"); pm.expect(b).to.not.have.property(\"passwordHash\"); });",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login organizer (seeded in dev)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
